== Candidates ==
On 18 March 2017, the [[Constitutional Council (France)|Constitutional Council]] published the names of the 11 candidates who received 500 valid sponsorships, with the order of the list determined by drawing lots.<ref>{{cite web|title=Liste officielle des candidats à l'élection présidentielle|url=https://presidentielle2017.conseil-constitutionnel.fr/liste-officielle-des-candidats-a-lelection-presidentielle/|publisher=Conseil constitutionnel présidentielle 2017|date=18 March 2017|access-date=18 March 2017|url-status = live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170414063724/https://presidentielle2017.conseil-constitutionnel.fr/liste-officielle-des-candidats-a-lelection-presidentielle/|archive-date=14 April 2017}}</ref>
